# The bytes of a notice written while an answer streams (T8): `/version`
# typed mid-stream, then the wire -- whether the notice's rows and the
# answer's are each inside the update that paints the band under them.
gateway notice-midstream-turn.json
wait 2
type stream a long answer please
key Enter
held
type /version
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 0.7
snap version
release
wait 5
snap end
snapfull end
wire end
